# Hakoda's "Sacrifice Hakoda: Creatures you control get +0/+5 and gain indestructible until end of turn." (CR 611.2c). On turn 1
# Bot1 has Hakoda (a Plains and Black Lotus) and an Earth Kingdom Protectors (Mox Pearl). On turn 2 Bot2 casts an Ornithopter and
# Lightning Bolts the Protectors; in response Bot1 sacrifices Hakoda: the Protectors are a 1/6 with indestructible and survive the
# 3 damage, Bot2's Ornithopter is still a 0/2. The effect is over on turn 3: Hakoda, the sacrificed, is in the graveyard.

